{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This taxi is a time machine.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305750/extras/ss02.png?t=1739539005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a taxi driver in a lunar city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with your passengers and bring them to the time they truly desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6The news is rewritten by the results of your chosen time travel.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305750/extras/ss05.png?t=1739539005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you deliver a passenger to the past or the future,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">history is rewritten and news headlines change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each passenger holds the fate of the world in his or her hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305750/extras/ss06.png?t=1739539005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...Because every passenger is a &quot;suspect in a presidential assassination.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A series of choices creates a time paradox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything depends on your driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305750/extras/ss01.png?t=1739539005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 100,000-character visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nostalgic pixel art animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parameters that are affected by your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings</p></li></ul><p class=